{"h":3396,"w":2400,"lines":[{"x":0.67656906362740221,"h":0.01900497679154356,"c":1,"w":0.23321164449055998,"y":0.037567698524127668,"t":"Sample Writing answers"},{"w":0.35802469889322919,"h":0.020434436865493177,"t":"TEST 3, WRITING TASK 1","x":0.069958843866142595,"y":0.084216726102150474,"c":1},{"x":0.069842798848301635,"y":0.11966267184394264,"h":0.020126279869124408,"c":1,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.5 score.","w":0.6977573140462241},{"t":"The South West airport had some changes after its redevelopment. The departures area was","x":0.067813265693358937,"w":0.77177337646484379,"h":0.022046240816689155,"c":1,"y":0.14667505332705244},{"h":0.020441285572568635,"y":0.16860465097494193,"w":0.79218109130859382,"t":"moditied to have a bag drop service, along with a cafe and check-in module that were already","c":1,"x":0.067901223712987069},{"c":1,"t":"there before the redevelopment. However, both the cafe and the check-in module changed places to","w":0.83966028849283869,"h":0.022022283259774733,"x":0.067818512085678906,"y":0.18852362519617216},{"w":0.83744857788085936,"c":1,"t":"make room for the bag drop. After going through security passport control, passengers and airport","x":0.067901224877966793,"y":0.20930232537969251,"h":0.020379653948636722},{"y":0.22815162434295155,"x":0.067776972327611887,"t":"staff will be able to purchase stuff at the new stores before their flight. After doing some shopping,","c":1,"h":0.023375865006194152,"w":0.82950571695963538},{"x":0.067836088504255945,"y":0.24991862539993459,"w":0.83550532023111979,"h":0.021817756625873042,"c":1,"t":"the boarding gates wait ahead. There are now 18 gates, which were 8 before the redevelopment. For"},{"t":"this reason, the walkaway installed between the gates has been replaced for a sky train, which will be","w":0.83950617472330735,"c":1,"y":0.27179034157514637,"x":0.067901233484669685,"h":0.018907332448431458},{"c":1,"t":"able to transport people along the different gates. But if you're not leaving the South West airport,","w":0.83333333333333326,"h":0.020391637220259273,"x":0.067901234401870264,"y":0.29210836295846621},{"y":0.31136959063839575,"t":"you'll be glad to know the arrivals area has also been redeveloped. After going through passport","w":0.81290786743164067,"x":0.067815714432826441,"c":1,"h":0.023467215548134579},{"h":0.019140164899882128,"c":1,"y":0.33274440520349979,"w":0.81893005371093741,"t":"control customs, passengers and airport staff will be able to hire different services. This area was","x":0.067901228092977897},{"x":0.067825474555938098,"y":0.35262311330817897,"h":0.020923308966718679,"c":1,"w":0.79644292195638022,"t":"empty before the redevelopment, but now it has an ATM, a cafe and a car hire service that will"},{"h":0.018974100883492717,"x":0.067901235522336664,"y":0.37354651201020972,"c":1,"t":"gladly take you to your destination.","w":0.29835390726725258},{"c":1,"w":0.31719429016113282,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","x":0.067740311685159607,"h":0.017593878037235777,"y":0.40835422431015722},{"t":"This response covers the key details required; however, it describes the changes","y":0.44429155772106399,"x":0.11513139107036503,"w":0.76560607910156242,"h":0.01948047947967857,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.11111110033254525,"y":0.46366279053864123,"w":0.79218109130859371,"h":0.017491508569256853,"t":"in the past tense instead of using future verb forms for the development 'next year'."},{"x":0.11512424672713933,"y":0.48046181059179427,"h":0.019440292610015675,"w":0.68949971516927078,"c":1,"t":"Overall, it could be improved by adding a summary of the main changes."},{"x":0.11304723166096144,"t":"The response has been organised logically by describing the changes to the","y":0.51513134071087641,"w":0.7245112101236979,"h":0.020432331817590965,"c":1},{"t":"journey through the redeveloped airport: firstly departures, then arrivals. There are","h":0.022833106374572143,"w":0.78218465169270845,"y":0.53228186476030692,"x":0.11096422874502981,"c":1},{"t":"some good cohesive features [However | After | Buf] and some referencing [which |","h":0.020340691466494421,"x":0.11308237631632503,"c":1,"w":0.79028732299804705,"y":0.55073235477631988},{"y":0.56976744169817206,"h":0.017441860778592888,"t":"This area]. Organisation could be improved by breaking the response down into","x":0.11728395446098261,"w":0.75102879842122394,"c":1},{"y":0.58863368663043603,"c":1,"w":0.23662551879882809,"h":0.016017476296396826,"t":"two or three paragraphs.","x":0.11316872197045162},{"h":0.021475635793661185,"x":0.11304322405990168,"y":0.6216422626603435,"w":0.79239735921223964,"t":"Vocabulary is a strength, with some effective collocation [changed places | take you","c":1},{"t":"to your destination] and flexibility [modified | installed between].","y":0.63987281183789213,"x":0.11309310941629221,"w":0.6009798177083332,"c":1,"h":0.018605671445669048},{"t":"In terms of grammar, this response has a variety of structures, but it describes","c":1,"x":0.11095787288695182,"h":0.022880590144540358,"w":0.74107233683268237,"y":0.67286401139042329},{"h":0.019398034391189811,"t":"some of the changes in the past simple [was modified] and in the present perfect","x":0.11311016925495324,"w":0.76554850260416674,"c":1,"y":0.69313574047822668},{"h":0.017472676590558955,"w":0.76954732259114578,"c":1,"x":0.11316872541912593,"t":"(has been replaced by] whereas the question asked for a description of the future","y":0.7122093021661432},{"c":1,"t":"changes. To improve the score, there should be a wider range of future structures","y":0.72965116262843976,"w":0.77160491943359377,"h":0.017441860778592999,"x":0.11316873351456745},{"h":0.016026036337772775,"y":0.74705535914907162,"x":0.11111111463125335,"w":0.3374485524495443,"c":1,"t":"to address the changes 'next year'."},{"w":0.039094648361206019,"h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.8662551450992324,"t":"135","y":0.91133720902636139,"c":1}]}